<Defs>
  <BackstoryDef>
    <defName>HE_Yamato_BS_Ashigaru</defName>
    <title>ashigaru footman</title>
    <titleShort>footman</titleShort>
    <description>[PAWN_nameDef] was a farmer's son until the clan drums called. [PAWN_pronoun] learned to hold a spear in a tight line and to dig in fast when arrows began to fall.</description>
    <slot>Adulthood</slot>
    <spawnCategories>
      <li>HE_Yamato</li>
    </spawnCategories>
    <skillGains>
      <Melee>5</Melee>
      <Plants>3</Plants>
      <Construction>2</Construction>
    </skillGains>
    <bodyTypeMale>Male</bodyTypeMale>
    <bodyTypeFemale>Female</bodyTypeFemale>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="HeirsOfEarth.HeirsCultureExt">
        <nation>HE_Yamato</nation>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </BackstoryDef>
  <BackstoryDef>
    <defName>HE_Yamato_BS_Swordsmith</defName>
    <title>swordsmith</title>
    <titleShort>swordsmith</titleShort>
    <description>For twenty winters [PAWN_nameDef] folded and hammered tamahagane in a mountain forge. [PAWN_pronoun] would rather break a flawed blade than let it leave the workshop.</description>
    <slot>Adulthood</slot>
    <spawnCategories>
      <li>HE_Yamato</li>
    </spawnCategories>
    <skillGains>
      <Crafting>8</Crafting>
      <Melee>2</Melee>
    </skillGains>
    <requiredWorkTags>
      <li>ManualSkilled</li>
    </requiredWorkTags>
    <bodyTypeMale>Male</bodyTypeMale>
    <bodyTypeFemale>Female</bodyTypeFemale>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="HeirsOfEarth.HeirsCultureExt">
        <nation>HE_Yamato</nation>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </BackstoryDef>
  <BackstoryDef>
    <defName>HE_Yamato_BS_Ronin</defName>
    <title>masterless samurai</title>
    <titleShort>ronin</titleShort>
    <description>When [PAWN_possessive] lord fell, [PAWN_nameDef] chose wandering over a shameful death. [PAWN_pronoun] sold [PAWN_possessive] sword to whoever paid and learned that honour does not fill a rice bowl.</description>
    <slot>Adulthood</slot>
    <spawnCategories>
      <li>HE_Yamato</li>
    </spawnCategories>
    <skillGains>
      <Melee>8</Melee>
      <Shooting>2</Shooting>
      <Social>1</Social>
    </skillGains>
    <bodyTypeMale>Male</bodyTypeMale>
    <bodyTypeFemale>Female</bodyTypeFemale>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="HeirsOfEarth.HeirsCultureExt">
        <nation>HE_Yamato</nation>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </BackstoryDef>
  <BackstoryDef>
    <defName>HE_Yamato_BS_Monk</defName>
    <title>temple monk</title>
    <titleShort>monk</titleShort>
    <description>[PAWN_nameDef] swept the stone steps of a mountain temple for years, tended its herb garden and nursed travellers who arrived sick. [PAWN_pronoun] will not raise a hand in violence.</description>
    <slot>Adulthood</slot>
    <spawnCategories>
      <li>HE_Yamato</li>
    </spawnCategories>
    <skillGains>
      <Medicine>6</Medicine>
